{"id": "D01", "split": "train", "tool": "radio_link_diagnosis", "question": "某 LTE 链路测得 SNR 8 dB、EVM 12%、BER 0.003、频偏 1800 Hz。请判断主要劣化因素，并说明排查的优先顺序。", "arguments": {"snr_db": 8, "evm_percent": 12, "ber": 0.003, "frequency_offset_hz": 1800}, "answer_paths": ["/status", "/findings"], "source_ref": "repo:references/network_optimization_workflow.md", "expected": {"status": "warning", "finding_count": 4, "findings": [{"cause": "noise_or_interference", "severity": "warning", "evidence": {"snr_gap_db": 2.0}, "actions": ["降低 MCS", "检查同频干扰与接收功率", "增加测量样本后重新估计信道"]}, {"cause": "carrier_frequency_offset", "severity": "warning", "evidence": {"normalized_offset": 0.12}, "actions": ["执行 lte_frequency_sync", "检查本振和多普勒补偿"]}, {"cause": "poor_signal_quality", "severity": "warning", "evidence": {"evm_percent": 12.0}, "actions": ["检查功放压缩、相噪和 IQ 失衡", "运行 evm_metrics 并按层/子带定位"]}, {"cause": "high_bit_error_rate", "severity": "warning", "evidence": {"ber": 0.003}, "actions": ["降低 MCS", "检查软解调、扰码和编码链"]}], "recommended_next_tool": "降低 MCS"}, "kind": "tool_call", "scenario_id": "draft_D01", "origin_type": "expert_authored", "reviewer": "PENDING_BUSINESS_REVIEW", "review_status": "draft"}
{"id": "D02", "split": "selection", "tool": "link_adaptation_optimizer", "question": "链路 SNR 为 15 dB，可用 25 个 PRB，预留 2 dB 裕量，目标 BLER 为 0.1。请给出链路自适应建议。", "arguments": {"snr_db": 15, "nprb": 25, "margin_db": 2, "bler_target": 0.1}, "answer_paths": ["/recommended_mcs", "/modulation", "/tbs_bits_per_subframe"], "source_ref": "repo:references/network_optimization_workflow.md", "expected": {"recommended_mcs": 15, "itbs": 14, "modulation": "16QAM", "rv": 0, "tbs_bits_per_subframe": 7224, "estimated_peak_mbps": 7.224, "effective_snr_db": 13.0, "margin_db": 2.0, "bler_target": 0.1, "method": "conservative_threshold_plus_3gpp_tables"}, "kind": "tool_call", "scenario_id": "draft_D02", "origin_type": "expert_authored", "reviewer": "PENDING_BUSINESS_REVIEW", "review_status": "draft"}
{"id": "D03", "split": "holdout", "tool": "resource_allocation_optimizer", "question": "两个用户分别有 SNR 15 dB、需求 5000 kbps、优先级 2，和 SNR 5 dB、需求 2000 kbps、优先级 1；共有 25 个 PRB。怎样分配资源，各自需求能否满足？", "arguments": {"users": "[{\"id\":\"u1\",\"snr_db\":15,\"demand_kbps\":5000,\"priority\":2},{\"id\":\"u2\",\"snr_db\":5,\"demand_kbps\":2000,\"priority\":1}]", "total_prbs": 25}, "answer_paths": ["/allocations", "/allocated_prbs"], "source_ref": "repo:references/network_optimization_workflow.md", "expected": {"total_prbs": 25, "allocated_prbs": 25, "allocations": [{"id": "u1", "allocated_prbs": 24, "mcs": 15, "modulation": "16QAM", "tbs_bits_per_subframe": 6968, "estimated_kbps": 6968, "demand_kbps": 5000.0, "demand_met": true}, {"id": "u2", "allocated_prbs": 1, "mcs": 6, "modulation": "QPSK", "tbs_bits_per_subframe": 328, "estimated_kbps": 328, "demand_kbps": 2000.0, "demand_met": false}], "method": "weighted_marginal_tbs"}, "kind": "tool_call", "scenario_id": "draft_D03", "origin_type": "expert_authored", "reviewer": "PENDING_BUSINESS_REVIEW", "review_status": "draft"}
{"id": "D04", "split": "train", "tool": "closed_loop_validator", "question": "调整前吞吐 10、BER 0.01、时延 30 ms；调整后吞吐 12、BER 0.001、时延 25 ms。约束为 BER 不超过 0.002、时延不超过 30 ms。此次调整是否应验收，是否建议回滚？", "arguments": {"before": "{\"throughput\":10,\"ber\":0.01,\"latency_ms\":30}", "after": "{\"throughput\":12,\"ber\":0.001,\"latency_ms\":25}", "constraints": "{\"ber\":{\"max\":0.002},\"latency_ms\":{\"max\":30}}"}, "answer_paths": ["/accepted", "/rollback_recommended"], "source_ref": "repo:references/network_optimization_workflow.md", "expected": {"accepted": true, "score": 0.4222222222222223, "comparisons": {"ber": {"before": 0.01, "after": 0.001, "direction": "lower", "improvement_fraction": 0.9000000000000001, "result": "improved"}, "latency_ms": {"before": 30.0, "after": 25.0, "direction": "lower", "improvement_fraction": 0.16666666666666666, "result": "improved"}, "throughput": {"before": 10.0, "after": 12.0, "direction": "higher", "improvement_fraction": 0.2, "result": "improved"}}, "constraint_violations": [], "rollback_recommended": false}, "kind": "tool_call", "scenario_id": "draft_D04", "origin_type": "expert_authored", "reviewer": "PENDING_BUSINESS_REVIEW", "review_status": "draft"}
